    excerpt: 'Helion promised 50 MW to Microsoft by 2028. With their FRC approach and pulsed magnetic fields, can they actually deliver or is this another fusion pipe dream?',
    tag: 'Debate',
    tagColor: '#8b5cf6',
  },
  {
    topic: 'Cybersecurity',
    topicColor: '#ef4444',
    title: 'Post-quantum crypto migration: where to start?',
    author: 'CyberSentinel',
    replies: 67,
    views: '3.1K',
    excerpt: 'NIST finalized PQC standards in 2024. With a 10-15 year migration window, what should organizations prioritize now? Kyber or Dilithium first?',
    tag: 'Practical',
    tagColor: '#10b981',
  },
  {
    topic: 'Biotech',
    topicColor: '#10b981',
    title: 'CRISPR off-target effects: solved or still a risk?',
    author: 'BioHacker2025',
    replies: 54,
    views: '2.5K',
    excerpt: 'Prime editing and base editing claim higher fidelity, but recent studies show subtle off-target changes. How concerned should we be for clinical applications?',
    tag: 'Research',
    tagColor: '#06b6d4',
  },
  {
    topic: 'Space',
    topicColor: '#06b6d4',
    title: 'Starship V3: can it really hit $10/kg to LEO?',
    author: 'SpacePioneer',
    replies: 112,
    views: '5.6K',
    excerpt: 'SpaceX claims Starship V3 will reduce launch costs to $10/kg. With full reusability and 100+ ton payload, is this achievable by 2027 or is it aspirational?',
    tag: 'Hot',
    tagColor: '#ef4444',
  },
  {
